<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95499" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμήρισμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>air-tight fitting</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			<i>tube with another inside it as in a siphon or syringe</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hero
				<u>Spir.</u>
				1.6
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>tube with another passing through it at right angles, tap,
				stopcock</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				2.10
			</span></i>: 
				Dim.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σμηρισμάτιον</span></b> , τό, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.6
			</span></i>.</div>
